      <h1>{{ section.settings.s4 }}</h1>
      <p class="sub"><span class="chip" style="background:var(--stone-sibling-rivalry)"></span>FILLER — stone origin to come &middot; FILLER — style to come</p>
      <blockquote>{{ section.settings.s5 }}</blockquote>

      <p class="fieldlabel">{{ section.settings.s6 }}</p>
      <div class="sizes" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Size">
        <button aria-current="true" data-size="100ml" data-price="160"><span class="szl">100 ml</span><span class="szp">&pound;160</span><span class="szi">The printed story is in the box</span></button>
        <button data-size="7-5ml" data-price="25"><span class="szl">7.5 ml</span><span class="szp">&pound;25</span><span class="szi">Printed sleeve, no story</span></button>
        <button data-size="sample" data-price="5"><span class="szl">Sample &mdash; 2 ml</span><span class="szp">&pound;5</span><span class="szi">2ml, and its opening page</span></button>
      </div>

      <div class="cta">
        <button class="btn btn-ink" data-size="100ml" onclick="addToBag('sibling-rivalry',this.dataset.size,this)">Add to bag &mdash; &pound;160</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghostink applepay" onclick="addToBag('sibling-rivalry',document.querySelector('.pdp .cta .btn-ink').dataset.size||'100ml',this)"><svg class="i-apple" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M318.7 268.7c-.2-36.7 16.4-64.4 50-84.8-18.8-26.9-47.2-41.7-84.7-44.6-35.5-2.8-74.3 20.7-88.5 20.7-15 0-49.4-19.7-76.4-19.7C63.3 141.2 4 184.8 4 273.5q0 39.3 14.4 81.2c12.8 36.7 59 126.7 107.2 125.2 25.2-.6 43-17.9 75.8-17.931.8 0 48.3 17.9 76.4 17.9 48.6-.7 90.4-82.5 102.6-119.3-65.2-30.7-61.7-90-61.7-91.9zm-56.6-164.2c27.3-32.4 24.8-61.9 24-72.5-24.1 1.4-52 16.4-67.9 34.9-17.5 19.8-27.8 44.3-25.6 71.9 26.1 2 49.9-11.4 69.5-34.3z"/></svg> Apple Pay</button>
      </div>
      <p class="re"><span data-sizeline>Hand-carved stone lid, and the nine printed pages, in the box.</span></p>

      <!-- On a phone the Add button starts below the fold and is gone by the
           second screen. The bar stands in for it whenever the real button is
           not on screen — including on arrival — and restates the chosen size
           and price so it never asks for a decision the reader cannot see. -->
      <div class="pdpbar" id="pdpbar" hidden>
        <div class="r">
          <div class="t"><b>{{ section.settings.s7 }}</b><span data-barprice>&pound;160 &middot; 100 ml</span></div>
          <button class="btn btn-ink" data-size="100ml" onclick="addToBag('sibling-rivalry',this.dataset.size,this)">Add to bag</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc">
            <details open><summary>{{ section.settings.s8 }}</summary><div class="body">FILLER — story summary to come. <br><br>Story III, in nine pages, printed and boxed with the bottle; the digital edition arrives with your confirmation.</div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s9 }}</summary><div class="body"><div class="notelist"><p><b>{{ section.settings.s10 }}</b><span>{{ section.settings.s18 }}</span></p><p><b>{{ section.settings.s11 }}</b><span>{{ section.settings.s19 }}</span></p><p><b>{{ section.settings.s12 }}</b><span>{{ section.settings.s20 }}</span></p></div><p class="hint">{{ section.settings.s13 }}</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s14 }}</summary><div class="body">FILLER — stone origin to come, hand-cut. Veining is decided by the block, so no two lids repeat. The lid lifts free of the glass and keeps its weight in the hand.</div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s15 }}</summary><div class="body">Complimentary UK delivery over &pound;30, otherwise &pound;5. Two to four working days, signed for. FILLER &mdash; returns window to come. Samples are non-returnable.</div></details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
